{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"half-life-calculator UI copy.howAnswer","detected_language":"tl","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"half-life-calculator.copy.howAnswer","keys":["half-life-calculator.copy.howAnswer"],"locale":"fil","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"> Ang modelo ay natitirang halaga = unang halaga × (ZXQPH0000QXZ / ZXQPH0001QXZ) ^ (nakalipas na oras ÷ kalahati-buhay). Pumili kung aling halaga upang malutas, ipasok ang iba pang tatlong, at gamitin ang parehong yunit ng oras para sa nakalipas na oras at kalahati-buhay. Pagkatapos ng isang kalahati-buhay, ZXQPH0002QXZ ay nananatiling; pagkatapos ng dalawang, ZXQPH0003QXZ. Ito ay isang matematiko modelo, hindi medikal, kaligtasan o paghawak ng payo.","record_id":"2c6f597dd2c407c3f28534eac831a4299a92799cbaa58ad2eab15824a2149509","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"41028627586","seconds":2.028499317375008,"source":"The model is remaining amount = initial amount × (1/2)^(elapsed time ÷ half-life). Choose which value to solve, enter the other three, and use the same time unit for elapsed time and half-life. After one half-life, 50% remains; after two, 25%. This is a mathematical model, not medical, safety or handling advice.","source_commit":"0795f2ac94fd96942ab121fbeaaccf7766f584d4","source_hash":"8613317289246f6264e45987f0be8e56b0a638ff9f86b08fdfaa763dd3fe62c0","status":"machine-draft","translation":"> Ang modelo ay natitirang halaga = unang halaga × (1 / 2) ^ (nakalipas na oras ÷ kalahati-buhay). Pumili kung aling halaga upang malutas, ipasok ang iba pang tatlong, at gamitin ang parehong yunit ng oras para sa nakalipas na oras at kalahati-buhay. Pagkatapos ng isang kalahati-buhay, 50% ay nananatiling; pagkatapos ng dalawang, 25%. Ito ay isang matematiko modelo, hindi medikal, kaligtasan o paghawak ng p